D节点\n\n5、将人物图给到面部细化节点\n\n模型选择\n\n1、Checkpoint模型选择SDXL模型（ECOMID目前只支持SDXL模型）\n\n2、Load InstantlD lpa Model选择ip-adapter.bin\n\n3、Load PuLID Model (EcomlD)选择ip-adapter_pulid sdxl fp16.safetensors\n\n4、ControlNet加载器选择instantid/diffusion_pytorch_model.safetensors\n\n5、检测加载器选择bbox/face_yolov8m.pt\n\n参数调整\n\n1、不需要写提示词\n\n2、ECOMIDip_weight推荐0.3-0.4，具体根据实际效果调整\n\n3、ECOMIDcn_strength推荐0，动漫换脸可以调高\n\n4、面部细节步数30\n\n5、面部细节CFG6\n\n6、其他默认\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [418.4437561035156, 452.8747863769531], "pos": [211, -578], "id": 22, "properties": {}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [19], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [405.441162109375, 613.2066650390625], "pos": [1781, -574], "widgets_values": ["20221101125506_a3b4f.jpg", "image", ""], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 24, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "PULID", "slot_index": 0, "links": [14], "label": "PULID", "type": "PULID", "localized_name": "PULID"}], "size": [315, 58], "pos": [1120, 320], "widgets_values": ["ip-adapter_pulid_sdxl_fp16.safetensors"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 18, "type": "EcomID_PulidModelLoader", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "EcomID_PulidModelLoader"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [17], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [466.2740478515625, 647.1873779296875], "pos": [960, -593], "widgets_values": ["06e5849b4b5ab810de32fa02cfe22489a21a237415c2d5737d7dc04c3ad37b6f.png", "image", ""], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 23, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": 